# AWS Agent Toolkit skills to keep installed, one catalog name per line
# (`aws agent-toolkit list-available-skills`). bin/aws-agent-toolkit-ensure
# removes every installed aws skill not listed here and installs any listed
# one that is missing, in every agent the toolkit detects.
#
# Empty means none: the aws-mcp server stays configured and fetches the same
# skills on demand (search_documentation -> retrieve_skill). A static skill
# only buys implicit triggering, and each one costs 100-270 tokens of Codex's
# skill budget every turn (see agent_config/README.md, "Codex's budget is
# smaller"); the wizard's default set of 23 alone overruns it and gets every
# description shortened.
